📝 Notes & Reflections
Key Takeaways
The storage stack: disk → partition → PV → VG → LV → filesystem → mount

Always check both df -h and df -i when troubleshooting a full disk

LVM allows online extension without downtime

XFS cannot be shrunk; ext4 can

/etc/fstab mistakes can prevent boot — always test with mount -a



